r Eaters","g":"B","l":"Drake Maye fell right into the Beavers lap and he snatched him up."},{"y":2024,"t":"Jet-I","g":"B","l":"The Jet-I swooped in to the first round to take Ladd, but was it worth giving up future Hall of Famer Mike Evans?"},{"y":2024,"t":"Killer Klowns","g":"A","l":"You have to respect a founding father who does what it takes to save the team name."},{"y":2024,"t":"Lamb Chops","g":"A","l":"The Porkys should change their name to Corned Beef because they got lucky two times here."},{"y":2024,"t":"New World Order","g":"B","l":"After a big time hit in Sam Laporta last year NWO decides to give up Brian Robinson and jump into the draft."},{"y":2024,"t":"Pork Chop Express","g":"B","l":"The fog of Raider Nation once again takes hold."},{"y":2024,"t":"Powers Of Pain","g":"A-","l":"The Pain continues to rebuild the WR room destroyed by trades last summer."},{"y":2024,"t":"Still The Creams","g":"B-","l":"One thing you can count on in SCFL drafts is #WRScout picking up a WR."},{"y":2024,"t":"The Machines","g":"B","l":"The host extraordinaire! Machines welcomed The SCFL to Las Vegas and created a top notch draft weekend."},{"y":2025,"t":"Big Blue","g":"B-","l":"Big Blue showed up to the draft for the first time in a long time without the championship belt."},{"y":2025,"t":"Guido Haters","g":"C","l":"Signs of life have been limited from Guido camp."},{"y":2025,"t":"Heavy Hitters","g":"A-","l":"The Lamb\u2019s choice was the Hitters gain."},{"y":2025,"t":"Horse Collars","g":"B-","l":"Collars management took a break from the links \u26f3\ufe0f and was well prepared for the event."},{"y":2025,"t":"Jet-I","g":"B-","l":"The Jet-I moved in and out and up and down in the draft staying active in almost all moves on the day."},{"y":2025,"t":"Killer Klowns","g":"B","l":"The Champ Klowns went all in on attacking the RB weakness which included trading for Travis Etienne pre draft."},{"y":2025,"t":"Lamb Chops","g":"B","l":"The Lambs jumped out of the pen and dropped a bomb 